@section @code{stage/when}
@subsection Inputs
@code{_when}: The token @code{when} (ignored).
@code{conditional}: A conditional expression.
@code{_comma}: The token @code{,} (ignored).
@code{clauses}: A list of clauses to perform if the condition is true.
@code{_stop}: The token @code{.} (ignored).

@subsection Outputs
Returns a list representing an @code{if} expression with no else branch: @code{(if conditional clauses)}.

@subsection Processing
The function constructs an @code{if} expression where the @code{conditional} is evaluated, and if true, the @code{clauses} are executed. The ignored parameters (@code{_when}, @code{_comma}, @code{_stop}) are syntactic tokens that are not used in the output.

@subsection Side-Effects
None. The function is purely functional and returns a new list without modifying its inputs.

@section @code{stage/if-otherwise}
@subsection Inputs
@code{if}: The token @code{if} (ignored).
@code{conditional}: A conditional expression.
@code{comma}: The token @code{,} (ignored).
@code{clauses}: A list of clauses to perform if the condition is true.
@code{sem}: The token @code{;} (ignored).
@code{otherwise}: The token @code{otherwise} (ignored).
@code{otherwise-clauses}: A list of clauses to perform if the condition is false.
@code{stop}: The token @code{.} (ignored).

@subsection Outputs
Returns a list representing an @code{if} expression with both then and else branches: @code{(if conditional clauses otherwise-clauses)}.

@subsection Processing
The function constructs an @code{if} expression where the @code{conditional} is evaluated. If true, the @code{clauses} are executed; if false, the @code{otherwise-clauses} are executed. The ignored parameters (@code{if}, @code{comma}, @code{sem}, @code{otherwise}, @code{stop}) are syntactic tokens that are not used in the output.

@subsection Side-Effects
None. The function is purely functional and returns a new list without modifying its inputs.

@section @code{stage/unless}
@subsection Inputs
@code{unless}: The token @code{unless} (ignored).
@code{conditional}: A conditional expression.
@code{comma}: The token @code{,} (ignored).
@code{clauses}: A list of clauses to perform if the condition is false.
@code{stop}: The token @code{.} (ignored).

@subsection Outputs
Returns a list representing an @code{if} expression with no then branch: @code{(if conditional nil clauses)}.

@subsection Processing
The function constructs an @code{if} expression where the @code{conditional} is evaluated. If false, the @code{clauses} are executed (since the then branch is @code{nil}). The ignored parameters (@code{unless}, @code{comma}, @code{stop}) are syntactic tokens that are not used in the output.

@subsection Side-Effects
None. The function is purely functional and returns a new list without modifying its inputs.

@section @code{stage/repeat}
@subsection Inputs
@code{_repeat}: The token @code{repeat} (ignored).
@code{numeric}: A numeric expression specifying the number of repetitions.
@code{_times}: The token @code{times} (ignored).
@code{_colon}: The token @code{:} (ignored).
@code{clauses}: A list of clauses to repeat.

@subsection Outputs
Returns a list representing a @code{repeat} expression: @code{(repeat numeric clauses)}.

@subsection Processing
The function constructs a @code{repeat} expression that will execute the @code{clauses} @code{numeric} times. The ignored parameters (@code{_repeat}, @code{_times}, @code{_colon}) are syntactic tokens that are not used in the output.

@subsection Side-Effects
None. The function is purely functional and returns a new list without modifying its inputs.

